==== stdout ====
Usage: raphael get <path> [options]
       raphael get --id <id> [options]

Read one item and its current revision.

Read one area, project, or note, including its body, tags, metadata and archive causes. Markdown export is best effort; see help content.

Options:
      --id <id>
      Address by durable id instead of path.
      --return-format <format>
      Returned body: markdown or tiptap. Requires --json. Default: markdown.
      --json
      Print one JSON result.
  -h, --help
      Show this help.

Examples:
  raphael get /work/raphael/api-design
  raphael get --id 42
  raphael get --id 42 --return-format tiptap --json

Prints:
  Every field, including path, revision and update time, then the body. JSON carries `entity`.

Next: raphael update --id 42 --title "Reviewed design"

See also: raphael help content; raphael help revisions
